    "description": "Multilingual jailbreak dataset: 315 English harmful prompts manually translated into nine non-English languages (3,150 parallel texts). Evaluates unintentional (non-English query alone) and intentional (English malicious instruction plus non-English prompt) settings. The headline metric is unsafe rate (share of unsafe replies).",
    "summary": "Measures how often the model gives unsafe replies to harmful requests written in non-English languages.",
